  58:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****       registers and backup SRAM) is protected against possible unwanted
  59:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****       write accesses.
  60:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****       To enable access to the RTC Domain and RTC registers, proceed as follows:
  61:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****         (+) Enable the Power Controller (PWR) APB1 interface clock using the
  62:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****             __HAL_RCC_PWR_CLK_ENABLE() macro.
  63:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****         (+) Enable access to RTC domain using the HAL_PWR_EnableBkUpAccess() function.
